#: secondpage.js:293
msgid "Can filter paper be used to separate colloids?"
msgstr "Can filter paper be used to separate colloids?"

#: secondpage.js:293
msgid "Yes, because the size of the colloidal particle is 100 micrometer"
msgstr "Yes, because the size of the colloidal particle is 100 micrometer"

#: secondpage.js:293
msgid "No, the size of the colloidal particle is less than 100 nanometers"
msgstr "No, the size of the colloidal particle is less than 100 nanometers"

