msgstr "Drag the test tube and <br>drop it in the empty test tube A"

#: simcontrols.js:79
msgid ""
"Repeat the previous three steps for <br> the other two test tubes B and C"
msgstr ""
"Repeat the previous three steps for <br> the other two test tubes B and C"

#: simcontrols.js:81
msgid "Please wash and use the funnel"
msgstr "Please wash and use the funnel"

#: simcontrols.js:82 simcontrols.js:94
msgid "The solution will smell like a rotten egg"
msgstr "The solution will smell like a rotten egg"

#: simcontrols.js:84
msgid ""
"A colloidal solution is heterogenous, it appears translucent.<br> It cannot  "
"be filtered completely through filter paper.<br> Here solute particles do "
"not easily settle down on standing."
msgstr ""
"A colloidal solution is heterogenous, it appears translucent.<br> It cannot  "
"be filtered completely through filter paper.<br> Here solute particles do "
"not easily settle down on standing."

#: simcontrols.js:85
msgid ""
"A true solution is homogenous and transparent. <br>It can be completely "
"filtered through filter paper.<br> It remains stable on standing."
msgstr ""
"A true solution is homogenous and transparent. <br>It can be completely "
"filtered through filter paper.<br> It remains stable on standing."

#: simcontrols.js:86
msgid ""
"A suspension is heterogeneous mixture. <br>The particles of a suspension are "
"visible<br>to the naked eye. They settle down on <br>standing and can be "
"separated by filtration."
msgstr ""
"A suspension is heterogeneous mixture. <br>The particles of a suspension are "
"visible<br>to the naked eye. They settle down on <br>standing and can be "
"separated by filtration."

#: simcontrols.js:88
msgid "Click on the Reset button <br>to repeat the experiment again"
msgstr "Click on the Reset button <br>to repeat the experiment again"

